<title>POLAND: SOCCER-WIDZEW REGAIN POLISH CHAMPIONSHIP LEAD.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WIDZEW REGAIN POLISH CHAMPIONSHIP LEAD.</headline>
<dateline>LODZ, Poland 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish champions Widzew Lodz beat Legia Warszawa 1-0 on Saturday in a top-of-the table clash to regain first place in the table.</p>
<p>Jacek Dembinski scored in the 81st minute.</p>
